{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">GET-COLLATIONS function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309589","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-COLLATIONS-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-COLLATIONS-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"GET-COLLATIONS-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">GET-COLLATIONS function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">The GET-COLLATIONS function returns a comma-delimited\nlist of the collations either listed in <span class=\"ph filepath\">convmap.cp</span> or\nspecified by the Conversion Map (<code class=\"ph codeph\">-convmap</code>) startup\nparameter for the specified code page. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-COLLATIONS-function__syntax_GC18N52693573\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d225074e102\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-COLLATIONS-function__idGDL2HX2671121\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>GET-COLLATIONS ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">codepage</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">codepage</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A code page name. If there are no collations for the specified\ncode page, the AVM returns the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-COLLATIONS-function__example_GC18N62693581\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d225074e149\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure displays a list of the code pages available in memory\nfor the current ABL session and the collations available for each\ncode page:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-get.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-COLLATIONS-function__idGDL2HZ2671127\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE code-page-list AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE collation-list AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE ix             AS INTEGER   NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE jx             AS INTEGER   NO-UNDO.\n\ncode-page-list = GET-CODEPAGES.\n\nREPEAT ix = 1 TO NUM-ENTRIES(code-page-list):\n  DISPLAY ENTRY(ix, code-page-list) FORMAT &quot;x(19)&quot; COLUMN-LABEL &quot;Code Page&quot;\n    WITH DOWN FRAME a.\n  collation-list =<strong class=\"ph b\"> GET-COLLATIONS</strong>(ENTRY(ix, code-page-list)).\n\n  REPEAT jx = 1 TO NUM-ENTRIES(collation-list):\n    DISPLAY ENTRY(jx, collation-list) FORMAT &quot;x(19)&quot; \n      COLUMN-LABEL &quot;Collation&quot;\n      WITH DOWN FRAME a.\n    DOWN WITH FRAME a.\n  END.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-COLLATIONS-function__see-also_GC18N72693587\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d225074e187\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-CODEPAGES-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-CODEPAGES-function.html\">GET-CODEPAGES function</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-COLLATION-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-COLLATION-function.html\">GET-COLLATION function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-DB-CLIENT-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-DB-CLIENT-function.html\">GET-DB-CLIENT function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309589","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"GET-COLLATIONS function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-COLLATIONS-function.html","type":"Manual"}